  {
   "id": "s08",
   "section": "exchange",
   "speaker": "b",
   "narration": "So the path changes. The client sends a token, the edge verifies it, and only then does the service do any work.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "flow",
    "heading": "Where the check happens",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "label": "Client",
      "sub": "sends a token"
     },
     {
      "label": "Edge check",
      "sub": "verifies it"
     },
